# Vale packages fetched by `vale sync` (Google, write-good, alex, and any
# others a project adds). Only the DocsAssist style is this plugin's own and
# tracked; the rest are synced fresh by CI and by /docs-assist:setup.
assets/lint/vale/styles/*/
!assets/lint/vale/styles/DocsAssist/
!assets/lint/vale/styles/config/

# Regenerated check output. Tracking it poisoned check-claims.mjs, which
# resolves claims by grepping tracked source and began finding them in its
# own cache.
.docs-assist/claims/

# Working files that must not ship. Claude Code copies the whole repository
# into ~/.claude/plugins/cache on install, so anything tracked here lands in
# every user's cache. These are kept locally and archived on the
# `working-notes` branch; scripts/validate.mjs enforces the allowlist.
reports/
.docs-assist/loop/
.docs-assist/session-log.md
.docs-assist/state/
